Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra transaction sub-transaction txid 
                                                               ( --sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                                                               | --signed-sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                                                               )
                                                               [ --output-json
                                                               | --output-text
                                                               | --output-yaml
                                                               ]
                                                               

  Print a sub-transaction identifier.

Available options:
  --sub-tx-file FILEPATH   Input filepath of the JSON unsigned sub-transaction.
  --signed-sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the JSON signed sub-transaction.
  --output-json            Format output to JSON (default).
  --output-text            Format output to TEXT.
  --output-yaml            Format output to YAML.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
